    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being overwhelmed though. it's the math of it. i sit here and look at the bills and the overtime she's doing and i just realize that if i wasn't here, that money stays in the house. that the stress would just... vanish. it feels like a logical equation. less of me equals more for them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
