      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just an idea. i see them sleeping and i just think about how much lighter their lives would be if they didn't have to worry about me or how i'm failing them. it feels like the only way to actually help them is to stop being the problem. wouldn't it be more selfless to just let them move on without this constant shadow over them?",
